<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Index des Outils - SDIS 38</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #0d0f14;
            --surface: #161a22;
            --border: #2a3040;
            --orange: #ff6b1a;
            --text: #e8eaf0;
            --text-dim: #7a8099;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .container {
            background-color: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            max-width: 500px;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .logo-badge {
            background: var(--orange);
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: bold;
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 6px 15px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        p {
            color: var(--text-dim);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .link-card {
            background: #1e2330;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
            transition: transform 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
        }

        .link-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            border-color: var(--orange);
        }

        .icon {
            font-size: 30px;
        }

        .details {
            text-align: left;
        }

        .details span {
            display: block;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .details small {
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-size: 12px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <div class="logo-badge">SDIS 38</div>
    <h1>Portail de Gestion</h1>
    <p>Sélectionnez l'outil que vous souhaitez utiliser ci-dessous.</p>

    <a href="sdis38_remorque_permis.html" class="link-card">
        <div class="icon">🚒</div>
        <div class="details">
            <span>Compatibilité Remorque & Permis</span>
            <small>Calculateur de PTAC et vérification réglementaire</small>
        </div>
    </a>
</div>

</body>
</html>